        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions GNT625RDDCRGSBR, Reeded Garnet Door Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe very elegant Garnet Door Handle features a slim, reeded grip. This little pull is great for closet doors, pantry doors, and furniture. Choose from 8 inch, 10 inch, and 12 inch lengths in a wide array of finishes. The Garnet Reed Door Pull can be thru-bolt mounted, back-to-back mounted, or surface mounted.\r\n</p> \r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-GNT01-specifications.gif?v=1704354723\" width=\"593\" height=\"235\" border=\"0\" alt=\"First Impressions GNT01 Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available as a <a href=\"/products/back-to-back-garnet-reed-door-pull-pair-first-impressions-pr-gnt625-bst03002r\"><b> Back-to-Back Mounted Pair with Rosettes</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the First Impressions GNT625RDDCRGSBR Garnet Series 1 Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-810R-detailed-picture.jpg?v=1704354588\"><b>First Impressions GNT625RDDCRGSBR Detailed Picture</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-GNT01-specifications.pdf?v=1704262222\"><b>First Impressions GNT625RDDCRGSBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>GNT625008RDDCRGSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center: 5-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2.29\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1.43\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>GNT625010RDDCRGSBR</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 7-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2.29\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1.43\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>GNT625012RDDCRGSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 9-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2.29\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1.43\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This door pull is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths.</b> Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Cancelable or Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Garnet Reed Door Pull",
                "description": "The very elegant Garnet Door Handle features a slim, reeded grip. This little pull is great for closet doors, pantry doors, and furniture. Choose from 8 inch, 10 inch, and 12 inch lengths in a wide array of finishes. The Garnet Reed Door Pull can be thru-bolt mounted, back-to-back mounted, or surface mounted.\r\n",
